d go  back to that morning every day I wish  they had a normal local game on January  26th life truly isn't fair this is just  senseless despite the unimaginable pain  vanessa has managed to stay strong for  her three daughters  seventeen-year-old Natalia three year  old Bianca and nine month old Capri on  Sunday the wife of the late NBA star  shared beautiful photos of her and her  daughters celebrating their first Easter  without Kobe and Gigi she even posted  this adorable video of Bianca and Capri  enjoying some Easter treats  [Music]  [Music]  back in February a source close to the  family told ET that Vanessa knows the  grieving process will be long and hard  the source went on to say that Vanessa  found Kobe's memorial to be healing she  is overwhelmed with the outpouring of  love her and her family received it was  the perfect tribute to Kobe and Gigi  [Music]
 

